{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day Train is a \u201cwork background game\u201d designed to help you stay focused while working or studying.<br>With its soothing, minimalist design and a UI optimized for productivity, it helps reduce the stress of daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Constantly Changing Real-Time Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background scenery in Day Train continuously evolves in real time.<br>The view from the window is automatically generated, ensuring that you never get bored, even during long sessions.<br>Additionally, the in-game time syncs with real-world time, offering new visual experiences throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A UI Designed for Productivity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes built-in task management and timer features.<br>It not only provides a relaxing atmosphere but also actively supports your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Sounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background music in Day Train can be customized by adding music files from your local PC, allowing you to create the perfect ambiance for concentration.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520520?t=1752235988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520520?t=1752235988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520520/1db2685b2879d531816229ccf35514aee8e01863/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752235988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520520/1db2685b2879d531816229ccf35514aee8e01863/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752235988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day Train is a \u201cwork background game\u201d designed to help you stay focused while working or studying.<br>With its soothing, minimalist design and a UI optimized for productivity, it helps reduce the stress of daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Constantly Changing Real-Time Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background scenery in Day Train continuously evolves in real time.<br>The view from the window is automatically generated, ensuring that you never get bored, even during long sessions.<br>Additionally, the in-game time syncs with real-world time, offering new visual experiences throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A UI Designed for Productivity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes built-in task management and timer features.<br>It not only provides a relaxing atmosphere but also actively supports your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Sounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background music in Day Train can be customized by adding music files from your local PC, allowing you to create the perfect ambiance for concentration.</p>","developers":["Hinato Yumoto"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520520/header.jpg?t=1752235988","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3520520/990921827/c65003aa947aaf54ab757087b9a4fe6cd0bda43c/1750857796/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750090025","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3520520/990921827/c65003aa947aaf54ab757087b